completed_at: "2026-10-21T13:00:26.586Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 90
acceptance_criteria: Outer and nested trackers keep runtime/search/locks/transactions/checkpoints excluded in either initialization order; repeated initialization is byte-idempotent; unrelated ignore rules remain intact; curated eval queries remain trackable; both merge-attribute scopes remain effective
parent: pm-o2kc
risk: medium
confidence: 90
severity: high
resolution: "Reconcile tracker-specific cache rules without replacing sibling scopes, preserving user content, curated evaluation files and native line endings."
expected_result: Nested initialization in either order and repeated initialization preserve every tracker cache exclusion and merge scope.
actual_result: "Linked unit and actual CLI/Git journeys pass, including both orders and literal path controls. Typecheck, bounded mutation and packed npm/Bun/npx/bunx checks pass; hosted exact-head gates remain mandatory before merge."
